{"seq":4,"slug":"debugging-and-diagnostics","title":"调试与诊断","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/debugging-and-diagnostics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debugging-techniques","title":"调试技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/debugging-and-diagnostics/debugging-techniques","wordCount":2709,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"instruments-performance","title":"Instruments 性能诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/debugging-and-diagnostics/instruments-performance","wordCount":2444,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"crashes-and-logging","title":"崩溃与日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/debugging-and-diagnostics/crashes-and-logging","wordCount":2684,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"调试与诊断-简介\">调试与诊断 简介</h1><p>测试拦住大部分问题，但总有 bug、卡顿、崩溃溜到运行时——这时要靠调试与诊断工具快速定位。本章讲清这套工具：先是<strong>调试技巧</strong>（LLDB、断点的进阶用法、<code>po</code>/<code>expression</code> 在运行时检查与改值），然后是 <strong>Instruments 与性能诊断</strong>（用 Time Profiler 找 CPU 热点、Allocations/Leaks 找内存问题——把「感觉卡」变成「看见在哪卡」），最后是<strong>崩溃与日志</strong>（symbolication 把崩溃地址还原成代码行、Crashlytics 等崩溃收集、<code>os_log</code>/统一日志做结构化日志）。掌握诊断工具，让你从「猜 bug 在哪」变成「测量、定位、修复」——这是高效解决线上问题的关键。</p>\n"}